---
import system from '../data/union-pier-soft-city.json';
---
<section class="soft-city" id="soft-city" aria-labelledby="soft-city-title">
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">Union Pier / A Soft City reading</p>
    <h2 id="soft-city-title">A neighbourhood opens to its harbour.</h2>
    <p class="lede">{system.narrative}</p>
    <p class="reading">David Sim’s <em>Soft City</em> asks us to consider how the built environment supports everyday life. Here, that reading becomes a sequence of places and a set of questions we can test as the proposal develops.</p>
  </header>
  <nav class="chapter-nav" aria-label="Urban narrative chapters">
    {system.chapters.map(ch => <a href={`#soft-city-${ch.id}`}><span>{ch.id}</span>{ch.title}</a>)}
  </nav>
  <div class="chapters">
    {system.chapters.map(ch => <article id={`soft-city-${ch.id}`}>
      <div class="chapter-heading"><span>{ch.id}</span><div><p class="place">{ch.place}</p><h3>{ch.title}</h3></div></div>
      <p>{ch.text}</p>
      <figure><a href={`/images/union-pier-charleston/study-g/${ch.drawing}`} aria-label={`Open full drawing: ${ch.title}`}><img src={`/images/union-pier-charleston/study-g/${ch.drawing}`} width="1400" height="990" loading="lazy" alt={`${ch.title}: current revision G urban design drawing`} /></a><figcaption>{ch.test}</figcaption></figure>
    </article>)}
  </div>
  <div class="review-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Design review / Nine project questions</p><h3>What is demonstrated—and what needs testing?</h3><p>Each check connects an intention to evidence and a next action. The status describes the maturity of the study; it is not a score or a certification.</p></div>
  <div class="checks">
    {system.checks.map(check => <details>
      <summary><span class="check-id">{check.id}</span><span class="check-title">{check.theme}<small>{check.status}</small></span><span class="expand" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
      <div class="check-body"><p class="question">{check.question}</p><p>{check.move}</p><dl><div><dt>Evidence</dt><dd>{check.evidence}</dd></div><div><dt>Measure</dt><dd>{check.measure}</dd></div><div><dt>Next check</dt><dd>{check.next}</dd></div></dl></div>
    </details>)}
  </div>
  <aside class="method"><p>{system.precedent_note}</p><p>{system.method}</p><p>Current figures use revision G. The earlier shade percentages are superseded by the new massing and roofs; a new seasonal test is required. Historical maps and archived context uses will be reconciled in the next atlas stage.</p><a href="/downloads/union-pier/Union-Pier-Soft-City-review.pdf">Download the vector review and drawing set</a></aside>
  <div class="sources"><p>Reading / Author excerpts and architectural precedents; <em>Soft City</em> (2019)</p>{system.sources.map(source => <a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{source.title} ↗</a>)}</div>
</section>
<style>
.soft-city{padding:48px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--_tokens---color--line-soft);scroll-margin-top:78px;color:var(--_tokens---color--fg);min-width:0}.soft-city header{max-width:900px}.eyebrow,.place{font-size:12px;color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);margin:0 0 14px}.soft-city h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,52px);line-height:1.08;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0 0 24px}.lede{font-size:20px;line-height:1.55}.reading{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;max-width:77ch}.chapter-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;margin:36px 0}.chapter-nav a{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--_tokens---color--line-soft);font-size:13px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.chapter-nav span{color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);font-size:11px}.chapters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:32px}.chapters article{min-width:0;scroll-margin-top:78px}.chapter-heading{display:flex;gap:15px;margin:18px 0}.chapter-heading>span{font-size:12px;color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);padding-top:3px}.chapter-heading .place{margin-bottom:8px}.soft-city h3{font-size:25px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.2;margin:0}.chapters article>p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;min-height:130px}.chapters figure{margin:20px 0 0}.chapters img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--_tokens---color--line-soft)}figcaption{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);margin-top:12px}.review-heading{margin-top:56px;max-width:750px}.review-heading>p:last-child{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.checks{margin-top:24px}.checks details{border-top:1px solid var(--_tokens---color--line-soft)}.checks details:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--_tokens---color--line-soft)}summary{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:22px;padding:21px 0;cursor:pointer;align-items:flex-start}summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.check-id{font-size:11px;color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);padding-top:4px}.check-title{font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;flex:1}.check-title small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--_tokens---color--muted);margin-top:6px}.expand{font-size:23px;line-height:1}details[open] .expand{transform:rotate(45deg)}summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #7f9c8e;outline-offset:4px}.check-body{padding:0 0 25px 56px;max-width:1100px}.check-body>p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.65}.question{font-weight:600}.check-body dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:28px;margin:24px 0 0}dt{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px}dd{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65}.method{padding:24px;margin-top:32px;background:#7f9c8e12;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;max-width:1000px}.method a,.sources a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:3px}.sources{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 22px;font-size:11px;margin-top:24px}.sources p{width:100%;margin:0 0 4px}.sources a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
@media(max-width: 1023.98px){.chapter-nav{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.chapters{grid-template-columns:1fr}.chapters article>p{min-height:0}.check-body dl{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px}}
@media(max-width: 699.98px){.soft-city{padding:32px 0}.lede{font-size:17px}.chapter-nav{grid-template-columns:1fr}.chapter-nav a{padding:10px 0}.check-body{padding-left:0}summary{gap:12px}.check-title{font-size:16px}.soft-city h3{font-size:23px}}
</style>
